    "media:imagetext": "The 16-passenger Britten-Norman \"Trislander\" pictured on the front is the latest addition\nto the Stol Air Commuter fleet. Stol Air, the first airline in the United States to fly the roomy\nand comfortable \"Trislander,\" will be flying this exciting airplane in their new route between\nOakland and San Francisco.\nFlt. No.\n560\n570\n580\n590\n501\n511\n521\n531\n541\n551\n561\n571\n581\n591\n500\nOakland to San Francisco\n$16.20\nDeparts\n6:00am\n7:00am\n8:00am\n9:00am\n10:00am\n11:00am\n12:00Noon\n1:00pm\n2:00pm\n3:00pm\n4:00pm\n5:00pm\n6:00pm\n7:00pm\n8:00pm\nArrives\n6:15am\n7:15am\n8:15am\n9:15am\n10:15am\n11:15am\n12:15pm\n1:15pm\n2:15pm\n3:15pm\n4:15pm\n5:15pm\n6:15pm\n7:15pm\n8:15pm\nFrequency\nM-F\nM-F\nDaily\nEx Sa\nDaily\nDaily\nDaily\nDaily\nEx Sa\nDaily\nEx Sa\nDaily\nEx Sa\nDaily\nM-F\nFlt. No.\n660\n670\n680\n690\n601\n611\n621\n631\n641\n651\n661\n671\n681\n691\n600\nSan Francisco to Oakland\n$16.20\nDeparts\n6:30am\n7:30am\n8:30am\n9:30am\n10:30am\n11:30am\n12:30pm\n1:30pm\n2:30pm\n3:30pm\n4:30pm\n5:30pm\n6:30pm\n7:30pm\n9:00pm\nArrives\n6:45am\n7:45am\n8:45am\n9:45am\n10:45am\n11:45am\n12:45pm\n1:45pm\n2:45pm\n3:45pm\n4:45pm\n5:45pm\n6:45pm\n7:45pm\n9:15pm\nRESERVATIONS\n800-862-4660\npassenger check-in:\nSan Francisco - TWA Gate 53A\nOakland - TWA Ticket Counter\nFrequency\nM-F\nM-F\nDaily\nEx Sa\nDaily\nDaily\nDaily\nDaily\nEx Sa\nDaily\nEx Sa\nDaily\nEx Sa\nDaily\nM-F\nPOST\n*ARD\n62\n.. i\nTO:\n2015166.2549",
