    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Hourly departures between\nOakland Int'l and San Francisco Int'l\nSTOL AIR\nAlso connecting Santa Rosa, Concord,\nNapa/Vallejo, \u0026 Novato/San Rafael\nto San Francisco International Airport\nSTAL AIRI\nCOMMUTER",
